---
/*
  Connect page (Rehearsals): directory listings for the "connect" section.
  Shows every published listing whose category is in this section,
  grouped by category. Listings and categories are edited in Pages CMS.
  The introduction is Erin's draft wording ("Connection"), spelling fixed.
*/
import SectionLayout from '../layouts/SectionLayout.astro';
import DirectoryList from '../components/DirectoryList.astro';
---

<SectionLayout href="/connect/">
  <p><strong>Connection is key!</strong></p>
  <p>
    It is difficult to express hard emotions of pain and suffering to those we love. It is difficult
    to see the pain in their eyes, and feel like we are the reason for causing it.
  </p>
  <p>
    But it is so important to talk and share the load. More hands make lighter loads. We highly
    recommend speaking with professionals throughout your journey.
  </p>
  <p>Find local community groups below, join our conversations or start your own.</p>
  <DirectoryList section="connect" />
</SectionLayout>
